{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Provide a supported way to disable default truncation**\n\nEvery new default-limited exporter maps explicit `None` back to its default, although the public InsightExporter contract says `None` disables truncation. Callers therefore cannot opt out using the documented type. Distinguish omission with a sentinel, or consistently document and test another disable value such as zero.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7uC87S","finding_digest":"438dba5d5fbacb027d08059cf69ff0f29b1372669c53532aaa6782a2bba1abb2","finding_id":"arf_v1_iog3uxk7xlfqe7iiawopnh7q6k","finding_key":"insight/readme.md::max_record_size_bytes::none-disable-contract","identity_key":"insight/readme.md::max_record_size_bytes::none-disable-contract","line":77,"observation_digest":"dc0d054de69a24a1109ba2c6011b7cd162c32f7cdbdb98940df8b77e431d06c3","observation_id":"aro_v1_3qgqktpgtiskcee3uldacg342f","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/README.md","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_iog3uxk7xlfqe7iiawopnh7q6k","published_at":"2026-09-11T22:03:46Z","review_id":"arr_v1_au5e3inkypj77dyafq5zyn566k","reviewed_base_sha":"8742ad9c9535e1de042963963c6b439f656894ce","reviewed_head_sha":"7f24921722e226045a5f548585ea7fbad6134fcf","reviewer":"codex","start_line":75,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":720},"record_id":"art_v1_viwl4jlklovenk3fqsu4ntgpqq","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-11T22:03:46Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
